  "description": "Standalone metadata inspector for .NET assemblies — explore types, methods, fields, signatures, and IL bytecode. Interactive REPL plus one-shot mode; per-table drill-down, cross-table find, type and method scoped views, IL disassembly. Useful for diagnosing obfuscation results, comparing builds, or just reading bytecode without firing up a full decompiler. Free; no license required.",
